  "name": "github-gcinamdizwa-wind-energy-monitoring-forecasting",
  "notes": "I built WindScope, a local dashboard where I monitor modelled 100 m wind for any place and estimate turbine power. I train RNN/LSTM models on ERA5 history to forecast 24 hours ahead and map wind-power potential by municipality or province. It grew out of a CHPC workshop I worked on with colleagues.",
